{
  "_README": [
    "TEMPLATE ONLY — this file is NOT read by the build. Copy it to",
    "`google-services.json` (same directory) and replace every value with the",
    "real ones from the Firebase console:",
    "",
    "  Firebase console -> Project settings -> Your apps -> Add app -> Android",
    "  Package name: com.hoppin.hoppin_driver",
    "  -> Download google-services.json -> place it at",
    "     apps/driver/android/app/google-services.json",
    "",
    "`google-services.json` is GITIGNORED and must stay that way. It is not a",
    "secret in the cryptographic sense (it ships inside the APK), but it is a",
    "credential record for a real Firebase project, and a FABRICATED one in the",
    "repo would be worse than none: `android/app/build.gradle.kts` only applies",
    "the google-services plugin when the real file exists, so without it the app",
    "boots on NoopDriverFcmGateway and SAYS push is unavailable. With a fake one",
    "it would 'initialise' successfully and then fail every token request against",
    "a project that does not exist — a green build that lies about being",
    "push-capable.",
    "",
    "🔴 A REAL google-services.json IS NOT SUFFICIENT FOR PUSH TO WORK. Token",
    "registration (`POST /me/device-tokens`, device_os: \"android\") is BOUND and",
    "will succeed. DELIVERY is GATED on the backend's FCM_CREDENTIALS_FILE",
    "(gaps #15/#16) — until that lands, the server cannot send. See",
    "DOCS/06 and apps/driver/README.md's HUMAN-VERIFY section."
  ],
  "project_info": {
    "project_number": "REPLACE_ME_SENDER_ID",
    "project_id": "REPLACE_ME_PROJECT_ID",
    "storage_bucket": "REPLACE_ME_PROJECT_ID.appspot.com"
  },
  "client": [
    {
      "client_info": {
        "mobilesdk_app_id": "REPLACE_ME_APP_ID",
        "android_client_info": {
          "package_name": "com.hoppin.hoppin_driver"
        }
      },
      "api_key": [
        {
          "current_key": "REPLACE_ME_API_KEY"
        }
      ],
      "services": {
        "appinvite_service": {
          "other_platform_oauth_client": []
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "configuration_version": "1"
}
